  "merger_description": "Coles Group Limited (**Coles**) is an Australian public company (ASX: COL) that primarily operates:\n\n* supermarkets nationwide through its subsidiary, Coles Supermarkets Australia Pty Ltd (**CSA**)\n* retail liquor stores nationwide, trading under the Liquorland, Liquorland Warehouse and Liquorland Cellars brands\n* a property development arm, Coles Group Property Developments Ltd, that buys land and constructs shopping centres, standalone supermarkets and/or liquor outlets and then sells these completed sites to third party buyers.\n\nUrbus Property Group Pty Ltd (**Lessor**) is an Australian private property development company and has nominated the following entity, 382 Payneham Road Pty Ltd (**Nominee**), to enter into the lease.\n\nColes, via its subsidiary CSA, has signed a letter of offer with the Lessor and/or Nominee for a proposed lease of a Coles supermarket within a new shopping centre at 1460 Main North Road, Salisbury South SA 5106 (the **Acquisition**).",
